claimRewards
  ├── when the caller does not have REWARDS_OPERATOR_ROLE on the vault
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the to address is zero
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller has REWARDS_OPERATOR_ROLE on the vault
      ├── it should emit a RewardsClaimed event
      └── it should call claimTo on the CometRewards contract
